WEBVTT

00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:06.440
My name is Tetsunosuke Sasaki 
who silences crying babies.

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:09.070
Graduated from bad boy to cherry boy.

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:11.780
A lot went down and I've 
had a change of heart.

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:14.780
A lot going on and I'm off to a new start.

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:17.700
Got a letter to deliver, quick as a dart.

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:20.790
But then I got my shit knocked out, yo.

00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:23.400
Cherry boy! Cherry boy!

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:25.910
Cherry boy! Cherry boy!

00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:28.960
This is my brother, Isaburo Sasaki.

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:31.820
He loves sending e-mails but 
he ain't got any mail buddies.

00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:34.970
No mail buddies. No mail buddies.

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:37.540
Yo! Yo! Yo! Yo!

00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:39.970
Always ready for any situation.

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.100
His plan is to wipe everyone out, yo.

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:46.150
Always ready for any situation.

00:00:46.150 --> 00:00:48.670
Ready. Ready.

00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:51.980
Shinsengumi, Check It Out Gang, and me.

00:00:51.980 --> 00:00:54.240
Cherry boy! Cherry boy!

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:57.450
Shinsengumi, Check It Out Gang, and me!

00:00:57.450 --> 00:00:59.870
Cherry boy! Cherry boy!

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:01.020
Yeah.

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:05.000
Uh, can you cut it out?

00:02:45.850 --> 00:02:47.790
A rather disparate trade.

00:02:47.790 --> 00:02:49.970
To think that fool would hold as

00:02:49.970 --> 00:02:53.500
much worth as the leaders of the 
Shinsengumi and Mimawarigumi?

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:55.150
Onward, men.

00:02:55.150 --> 00:02:56.810
We need not concern 
ourselves with the hostage.

00:02:56.810 --> 00:02:59.810
Wipe out the Joi.

00:03:03.270 --> 00:03:04.620
Go ahead and draw your sword.

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:06.480
I'll jam it right up your ***.

00:03:07.030 --> 00:03:10.070
This is our battle.

00:03:10.070 --> 00:03:13.280
We're ready to cut our way 
through the bramble to get in.

00:03:13.280 --> 00:03:17.530
It won't be easy to get through these thorns.

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:22.080
I believe that you look like 
anything but a cop right now.

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:23.800
Right back at you.

00:03:25.520 --> 00:03:27.960
-Evil bastard.
-Evil bastard.

00:03:27.960 --> 00:03:33.970
<b>Festival of Thornies</b>

00:03:57.480 --> 00:04:03.000
Hijikata-san, do you expect 
me to take your gamble?

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:05.470
You'll have to beat us

00:04:05.470 --> 00:04:08.610
if you want to get rid of your brother,

00:04:08.610 --> 00:04:10.010
so you don't really have a choice.

00:04:11.670 --> 00:04:16.100
If my goal is to ruin your reputation

00:04:16.100 --> 00:04:18.890
while disposing of my worthless brother,

00:04:18.890 --> 00:04:23.520
I simply have to alert those thugs to 
the small band you sent in.

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:27.850
Once I do that, the hostage will quickly die,

00:04:27.850 --> 00:04:31.530
along with your organization, 
which caused this mess.

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:34.020
It's very simple.

00:04:34.020 --> 00:04:37.670
Men, do not be fooled by his cheap taunts.

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:40.160
It would be idiotic for police officers

00:04:40.160 --> 00:04:42.410
to fight each other while the enemy watches.

00:04:42.410 --> 00:04:44.990
The Mimawarigumi have a responsibility to uphold.

00:04:44.990 --> 00:04:47.670
We will not move a single step or lift a single finger.

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:50.510
You are sadly mistaken, Hijikata-san.

00:04:50.510 --> 00:04:55.430
My goal is not to eliminate the 
Shinsengumi and my brother.

00:04:55.650 --> 00:04:58.430
It's to find a solution to this 
mess in an expedient manner.

00:04:58.830 --> 00:05:04.770
I do not wish to waste my time or people on this farce.

00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:06.480
In other words...

00:05:08.190 --> 00:05:10.960
I simply need

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:15.200
to eliminate the thorn in my side.

00:05:16.650 --> 00:05:19.010
That's more like it.

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:22.370
So despite being raised in a greenhouse,

00:05:22.950 --> 00:05:26.020
you haven't forgotten your primal instincts.

00:05:26.370 --> 00:05:27.770
Rosy.

00:05:28.380 --> 00:05:31.500
You're about to learn what happens

00:05:32.290 --> 00:05:36.640
when you defy the Mimawarigumi, brat!

00:06:02.490 --> 00:06:04.910
That woman's like a bringer of death.

00:06:05.120 --> 00:06:07.720
Every strike she makes is lethal.

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:09.750
Was she trained as an assassin?

00:06:10.290 --> 00:06:12.520
We don't have time to admire her technique.

00:06:12.520 --> 00:06:14.360
If she attracts too much attention,

00:06:14.360 --> 00:06:17.170
the enemy will realize we're here!

00:06:17.170 --> 00:06:18.970
If that happens, Tetsu will be...

00:06:19.490 --> 00:06:21.600
It's not that simple.

00:06:21.600 --> 00:06:25.180
If she gets behind enemy lines, 
she might kill Tetsu!

00:06:27.220 --> 00:06:28.170
Who are you?!

00:06:28.170 --> 00:06:29.350
We're under atta—

00:06:37.060 --> 00:06:40.360
I knew you weren't a cop.

00:06:40.990 --> 00:06:42.740
You have the eyes of a killer,

00:06:42.970 --> 00:06:44.760
just like me.

00:06:45.370 --> 00:06:48.750
Zaki, look after Kondo-san for me.

00:06:49.160 --> 00:06:51.000
Sogo! You can't mean to—

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:55.750
Kondo-san, she doesn't 
want that loser's head,

00:06:55.750 --> 00:06:57.510
and she's not interested in the enemy either.

00:07:01.510 --> 00:07:03.330
She wants my head.

00:07:03.330 --> 00:07:04.440
No.

00:07:11.050 --> 00:07:13.520
I want your ***.

00:07:31.740 --> 00:07:33.450
We'll let Sogo handle this.

00:07:33.450 --> 00:07:34.450
Let's go!

00:07:34.450 --> 00:07:35.340
Oh. Yes, sir!

00:07:48.570 --> 00:07:54.220
Will your *** or my *** get busted up first?

00:07:55.220 --> 00:07:56.540
Fun stuff.

00:08:27.390 --> 00:08:28.890
Dance for me.

00:08:39.300 --> 00:08:43.070
He used that shot to lead me into his attack!

00:08:43.150 --> 00:08:44.530
In that case...

00:08:51.620 --> 00:08:53.000
It's over.

00:09:05.470 --> 00:09:08.010
Vice Chief!

00:09:15.130 --> 00:09:17.480
This farce is over.

00:09:17.480 --> 00:09:20.180
V-Vice Chief!

00:09:20.180 --> 00:09:21.980
F-For real?

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:28.020
You did it! You really did it, Sasaki!

00:09:28.020 --> 00:09:31.420
What's that? Why are they lining up?

00:09:32.550 --> 00:09:34.350
What are you people doing?!

00:09:34.350 --> 00:09:36.510
Aren't you worried about what 
might happen to this guy?

00:09:38.060 --> 00:09:40.130
Hey, hold up!

00:09:40.130 --> 00:09:41.910
Don't you care about your brother?!

00:09:41.910 --> 00:09:43.760
Stop! Stop!

00:09:44.600 --> 00:09:46.400
Is he serious?

00:09:46.400 --> 00:09:48.750
He's going to sacrifice his brother.

00:09:48.750 --> 00:09:52.010
So this guy is a worthless hostage?

00:09:52.010 --> 00:09:53.370
D-Dammit!

00:09:53.370 --> 00:09:55.010
W-Wait!

00:09:55.010 --> 00:09:56.900
What about this?!

00:09:56.520 --> 00:10:04.150
<b>Tamegoro Hijikata</b>

00:09:56.900 --> 00:10:00.690
I already know that this is a secret message,

00:10:00.690 --> 00:10:04.150
since this guy was trying 
his best to protect it!

00:10:04.150 --> 00:10:06.350
That's the vice chief's...

00:10:06.350 --> 00:10:09.160
Stop! That letter is...

00:10:09.390 --> 00:10:12.280
There's a fake name on the envelope,

00:10:12.280 --> 00:10:15.190
but the address is the Mimawarigumi station.

00:10:15.190 --> 00:10:18.680
This is a letter Hijikata tried to send you!

00:10:18.680 --> 00:10:21.420
Impossible... The vice chief's 
letter was for my brother?

00:10:21.420 --> 00:10:25.920
Considering the effort that went 
into disguising this letter,

00:10:25.920 --> 00:10:27.950
it must be important.

00:10:27.950 --> 00:10:29.930
Don't you care what happens to it?

00:10:30.970 --> 00:10:34.370
Oh? A letter from Hijikata-san to me?

00:10:34.800 --> 00:10:37.180
You've managed to pique my interest.

00:10:37.180 --> 00:10:38.930
Don't play dumb!

00:10:38.930 --> 00:10:43.930
Then I'll read it out loud 
for everyone to hear!

00:10:43.930 --> 00:10:46.190
Please do.

00:10:46.190 --> 00:10:46.690
What?!

00:10:48.190 --> 00:10:49.970
You've got balls.

00:10:49.970 --> 00:10:51.450
Then I'll read your letter!

00:10:51.450 --> 00:10:52.890
Let's see...

00:10:52.890 --> 00:10:53.910
Uh...

00:10:53.910 --> 00:10:55.910
Er...

00:10:55.910 --> 00:10:57.110
The first word is "dear," boss.

00:10:57.110 --> 00:10:58.770
Shut up! I know that!

00:10:58.770 --> 00:11:00.540
Keep your mouth shut!

00:11:02.250 --> 00:11:04.150
Isaburo Sasaki-dono.

00:11:04.630 --> 00:11:06.960
Forgive me for sending this 
letter without warning.

00:11:08.270 --> 00:11:13.470
A letter addressed to the 
Mimawarigumi might cause a stir,

00:11:13.990 --> 00:11:19.330
so forgive me for using a false name.

00:11:20.570 --> 00:11:22.710
I believe that by using the name Hijikata,

00:11:22.710 --> 00:11:26.490
this letter will certainly reach your eyes.

00:11:28.140 --> 00:11:32.240
Your brother, Tetsunosuke, 
who is currently in our care,

00:11:33.190 --> 00:11:37.060
has completely changed,

00:11:37.060 --> 00:11:40.040
training hard under our watch every day.

00:11:42.420 --> 00:11:47.220
It will take some more time 
to work the damage

00:11:47.710 --> 00:11:50.010
from his lazy lifestyle out of his body,

00:11:51.050 --> 00:11:58.310
but he's doing his best to never stop, 
to keep moving forward.

00:11:58.430 --> 00:12:00.350
He's matured into a fine young man.

00:12:01.890 --> 00:12:06.170
I'm ashamed to admit that I've learned

00:12:06.170 --> 00:12:09.320
a thing or two by watching him struggle.

00:12:11.280 --> 00:12:14.970
I know that he will become a strong warrior.

00:12:15.620 --> 00:12:20.790
We will make him a strong warrior.

00:12:21.730 --> 00:12:29.240
So, when he becomes fully capable, 
please show him your approval.

00:12:30.350 --> 00:12:32.900
As his family, as his brother...

00:12:33.460 --> 00:12:37.020
Could you please accept him?

00:12:37.790 --> 00:12:41.560
I envy you.

00:12:42.580 --> 00:12:45.300
I'm sure that's what he wants.

00:12:46.260 --> 00:12:49.350
He may complain all the time,

00:12:50.590 --> 00:12:52.760
but I know how he truly feels.

00:13:07.360 --> 00:13:09.370
Because it's too late

00:13:10.880 --> 00:13:16.090
<b>Tamegoro Hijikata</b>

00:13:11.150 --> 00:13:12.480
for me.

00:13:21.020 --> 00:13:22.100
Vice Chief...

00:13:27.600 --> 00:13:30.110
That was a waste of time.

00:13:30.890 --> 00:13:32.480
Advance.

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:36.240
I-Isaburo!

00:13:49.280 --> 00:13:50.820
Stop!

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:54.420
Please stop this!

00:13:54.420 --> 00:13:58.200
Don't worry about me!

00:13:58.930 --> 00:14:03.680
Please! Vice Chief!

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:09.190
It seems that you're the type

00:14:11.660 --> 00:14:17.700
that keeps coming back until 
you've drawn your last breath.

00:14:17.700 --> 00:14:20.820
Get out of my way, Thorny.

00:14:24.700 --> 00:14:28.070
Fail to dodge it, and you die. 
Dodge it, and you still die.

00:14:28.070 --> 00:14:32.500
Bullet or blade. Pick your poison.

00:15:18.910 --> 00:15:20.320
Vice Chief...

00:15:24.060 --> 00:15:29.300
You should stick to decorating walls,

00:15:29.300 --> 00:15:31.460
you dirty rose.

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:37.210
This garden isn't for you people.

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:44.950
You are really something, Hijikata-san.

00:15:45.600 --> 00:15:47.510
Are you saying that the safety 
of an innocent citizen

00:15:47.510 --> 00:15:50.470
is more important than the 
resolution of this crisis?

00:15:50.470 --> 00:15:54.460
No, you're merely being selfish.

00:15:54.460 --> 00:15:59.590
You aren't trying to save 
my worthless little brother.

00:15:59.590 --> 00:16:02.970
You're trying to save the worthless 
little brother of the Hijikata family.

00:16:03.200 --> 00:16:07.910
It is not our duty to redeem criminals.

00:16:08.390 --> 00:16:10.730
Our duty is to punish criminals.

00:16:11.670 --> 00:16:15.880
You can't punish a criminal 
if you fear his crime.

00:16:16.350 --> 00:16:22.580
You must be prepared to suffer 
the same punishment you deal.

00:16:23.230 --> 00:16:27.410
We can never save a single soul.

00:16:27.410 --> 00:16:30.890
We aren't even allowed the 
right to save ourselves.

00:16:31.250 --> 00:16:34.340
A cog is supposed to keep on turning.

00:16:34.340 --> 00:16:36.500
We can never stop.

00:16:37.050 --> 00:16:40.010
You're out of time, Hijikata-san.

00:16:47.810 --> 00:16:51.890
Get 'em! Kill 'em all!

00:16:58.730 --> 00:17:00.500
D-Dammit!

00:17:00.500 --> 00:17:03.290
I'm taking you with us, then!

00:17:09.330 --> 00:17:11.250
Tetsu!

00:17:24.780 --> 00:17:28.260
Hello? This is Sabu-chan.

00:17:28.700 --> 00:17:32.580
Thank you for leading the 
Mimawarigumi here.

00:17:32.580 --> 00:17:36.490
Our ambush was a success.

00:17:36.490 --> 00:17:39.270
Is my job done then?

00:17:39.270 --> 00:17:43.530
Yes, we can take it from here.

00:17:44.860 --> 00:17:46.700
Really. Well, then.

00:17:49.920 --> 00:17:52.950
Time to do things my way.

00:17:54.960 --> 00:17:57.460
Wh-What are you...?!

00:17:58.000 --> 00:18:01.280
Oh? You're turning on us?

00:18:01.280 --> 00:18:02.960
That's fine.

00:18:02.960 --> 00:18:06.720
I don't need a mail buddy who never replies.

00:18:06.940 --> 00:18:10.450
I don't intend on leaving 
you in my address book.

00:18:13.930 --> 00:18:16.940
That's what I figured.

00:18:17.580 --> 00:18:19.150
Bastard...

00:18:19.150 --> 00:18:22.950
The Mimawarigumi's charge was 
meant to draw me up here.

00:18:23.410 --> 00:18:29.930
With the exits blocked, 
they must plan on killing us with the Joi.

00:18:30.450 --> 00:18:32.370
Wait, hold on.

00:18:32.370 --> 00:18:36.230
I'm not gonna side with the Shinsengumi.

00:18:36.230 --> 00:18:39.090
I've never been a fan of the police.

00:18:39.090 --> 00:18:42.390
Doesn't matter if you're wearing black or white.

00:18:42.390 --> 00:18:44.740
But it's pretty sad when two of the

00:18:44.740 --> 00:18:48.090
biggest police forces in Edo are having a childish spat.

00:18:48.090 --> 00:18:51.970
We got a foolish cop who only cares 
about saving the people he knows

00:18:51.970 --> 00:18:55.470
and a snappy cop who 
won't try to save anyone.

00:18:55.720 --> 00:18:58.760
I don't feel like joining either side.

00:18:58.760 --> 00:19:02.630
I'm gonna side with my boys here.

00:19:03.450 --> 00:19:06.680
If you aren't going to save these boys,

00:19:06.680 --> 00:19:10.060
I'll step in and save a few 
criminals in the process.

00:19:10.490 --> 00:19:13.200
Show me what you got, Vice Chief.

00:19:13.700 --> 00:19:15.490
You're first.

00:19:15.490 --> 00:19:19.600
Let's see if you can take down the Joi patriot

00:19:19.600 --> 00:19:22.500
known as the White Yaksha.

00:19:30.020 --> 00:19:31.680
Sasaki.

00:19:31.680 --> 00:19:38.460
You chose the wrong 
person to use as a cog.

00:19:39.660 --> 00:19:41.170
Don't bother.

00:19:41.170 --> 00:19:45.150
You don't stand a chance against

00:19:46.140 --> 00:19:48.680
the biggest thorn in the bush.

00:19:48.680 --> 00:19:52.650
You're the one who's lost his 
mind over a single brat.

00:19:52.650 --> 00:19:55.450
Are you too scared to fight me now?

00:19:55.450 --> 00:19:59.910
Maybe I should kill the hostage 
so you can focus on the fight?

00:19:59.910 --> 00:20:01.420
Go ahead.

00:20:02.030 --> 00:20:03.710
I've done what I can.

00:20:04.170 --> 00:20:06.540
If you're saying that he's not as important

00:20:06.540 --> 00:20:09.260
as the brats standing behind you, 
go ahead and kill him.

00:20:10.170 --> 00:20:15.560
As far as I'm concerned, they're all the same.

00:20:15.560 --> 00:20:19.930
No, you and I are the same.

00:20:20.820 --> 00:20:24.620
It won't make a difference if we 
kill another kid or two now.

00:20:24.620 --> 00:20:26.940
It's too late for that now.

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:32.700
We don't seek or expect forgiveness.

00:20:33.270 --> 00:20:36.520
And we're not interested 
in punishing criminals.

00:20:37.120 --> 00:20:41.970
So we can't punish criminals, 
and we can't redeem them,

00:20:42.680 --> 00:20:45.460
but there is something that only we can do.

00:20:46.540 --> 00:20:51.260
We can stop them from making 
the same mistakes we made.

00:20:52.130 --> 00:20:57.140
We can teach them to learn from 
those mistakes and move on.

00:20:59.770 --> 00:21:03.240
I'm not gonna give up on 
trying to save people

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:06.230
like Mr. Smartypants over there.

00:21:06.230 --> 00:21:11.300
We brats have to stick together.

00:21:11.300 --> 00:21:15.740
But if you still want to kill him, go ahead.

00:21:20.870 --> 00:21:21.870
Huh?

00:21:24.470 --> 00:21:27.380
You really killed him?!

00:21:27.380 --> 00:21:30.380
You told me to kill him!

00:21:32.380 --> 00:21:33.630
Wrong.

00:21:42.130 --> 00:21:44.020
Chief!

00:21:44.020 --> 00:21:45.980
I have the hostage!

00:21:47.150 --> 00:21:49.550
Way to hang in there.

00:21:49.550 --> 00:21:51.150
No need to hold back now!

00:21:51.390 --> 00:21:53.850
Go crazy!

00:21:54.730 --> 00:21:56.750
Thornies!

00:21:58.030 --> 00:21:59.950
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:23:30.710 --> 00:23:32.750
<b>Devil</b>

00:23:32.290 --> 00:23:34.590
<b>Monster</b>

00:23:34.000 --> 00:23:35.500
<b>White Yaksha</b>

00:23:37.260 --> 00:23:42.550
<b>The Thornies</b>

00:23:38.340 --> 00:23:42.550
<b>can't be stopped!</b>

00:23:42.550 --> 00:23:44.930
<b>Letter From Thorny</b>

00:23:44.930 --> 00:23:50.310
<b>The festival has kicked into full gear as the battle nears an end. The Thorny arc ends next episode!!</b>

00:23:50.310 --> 00:23:54.940
<b>A new letter has been written. What message does it carry...?</b>
